('Rights & grievance handling','Design intake, identity checks, routing and response records for access, correction, erasure, nomination and grievances.','Rights register, grievance tracker & response templates'),
('Vendor & processor governance','Classify vendors by data access and risk. Review questionnaires, contractual protections and onboarding controls.','Vendor register, questionnaires & contract clauses'),
('Training & awareness','Brief leadership and train branch, operations, IT, compliance, HR and customer-service teams with role-specific guidance.','Training materials, attendance & knowledge checks'),
